2 CONT ** Reference: [https://www.myheritage.com/research/collection-1/myheritage-family-trees?itemId=149287222-5-345&action=showRecord&indId=externalindividual-3d453c1922c55fd4126cae01f3ff863e&mrid=0906ee279e4dd56081f6c32f2d5873d6 MyHer
