1 NAME Anna Ommundsdatter /Stangaland/
2 GIVN Anna Ommundsdatter
2 SURN Stangaland
2 _MARNM Stangaland
1 SEX F
1 BIRT
2 DATE 15 MAR 1865
2 PLAC Helland
